---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import lisa from '../../assets/lisa-portrait.jpg';
import shopfront from '../../assets/shopfront.jpg';
import interior from '../../assets/shop-interior.jpg';
import cosmos from '../../assets/verge-cosmos.jpg';
---
<Base
  title="About | Tiny Flower House, Moss Vale"
  description="Tiny Flower House is a Moss Vale florist growing its own flowers on the nature strip at the corner of North and East Street. Irregular, venturesome, local."
>
  <Header slot="header" />
  <section data-section="manifesto" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 min-h-[70vh] flex items-center">
    <h1 class="font-display text-[8vw] md:text-[4.6vw] leading-[1.2]">Not your typical florist. We are guerrilla gardeners.</h1>
  </section>

  <section data-section="story" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <Picture src={lisa} widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 40vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} alt="Lisa holding a large bunch of flowers in front of her face in the workshop" class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover object-top" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>All of our flowers are grown here on our premises in Moss Vale, sourced from within the Southern Highlands or within 50 kilometres of Moss Vale. We use what is currently in season, so our bouquets are made up of the best seasonal flowers the Southern Highlands has to offer.</p>
      <p class="mt-6">The beds are on the public nature strip outside the house at the corner of North and East Street. We harvest early in the morning and in the evening, and the workshop is the little black cottage behind them. We're irregular, venturesome, and we love it.</p>
      <p class="mt-6">Flowers for love, laughter and loss. Whether to mark a special birthday or anniversary, as a gift of encouragement or to offer sympathy over a loss, flowers say it all.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-section="place" aria-label="The corner" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
    <Picture src={shopfront} widths={[480, 800]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} alt="The black cottage workshop with white French doors and round logo on the glass" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover" loading="lazy" />
    <Picture src={interior} widths={[480, 800]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} alt="Pink stocks in a vase beside a blue and white plate inside the workshop" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover" loading="lazy" />
    <Picture src={cosmos} widths={[480, 800]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} alt="Cosmos flowering on the nature strip with the street behind" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover" loading="lazy" />
  </section>
  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Base>
